Package: repli
Title: Replicate-based Imputation for Randomly Missing Data in Quantitative Proteomics
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Dick", "Zijlmans", email = "dickzijlmans@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-1527-1834"))
Description: 
    Implements replicate-based imputation for missing at random (MAR) values 
    in proteomics data. The method leverages existing measurements from other
    replicates to determine imputation parameters (mean of observed values and
    global standard deviation).
